        "department": null,
        "description": "This course provides a comprehensive understanding of Human-Centered AI (HAI), focusing on designing AI systems that prioritize user needs, inclusivity, and accessibility. Students will explore the integration of user-centered design principles with AI technologies to create systems that are understandable, fair, and transparent. Emphasis will be placed on addressing ethical challenges such as bias and fairness while fostering effective human-AI interactions and ensuring responsible AI development.",
